{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人歐瑞偉、李偉健、何依婷、容天佑，關曜儁等今日（8日）現身北角為《愛·回家之三代同糖》宣傳，歐瑞偉與李偉健穿上肌肉圖案上衣及手戴拳套在街頭進行拳賽，不過由於李偉健有傷在身，故最後改由容天佑頂上。</p><p>李偉健自言因腹膜受傷，已停了5個月未能做運動</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.639024+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T09:19:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"8ffa4c70ec22bcc52eb1d76e5fe84cdd7cd83e71d4ebcad4947362affde26618","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}